### FiscalAnalyzer - HTTP Routes
### Use com IntelliJ HTTP Client ou extensão REST Client (VS Code)
### Pré-requisito: API local rodando (ex.: ./scripts/run-local.sh)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantId = 99
@empresaId = 99
@importacaoId = 1
@accessKey = 35191111111111111111550010000000011000000010
@agentApiKey = fa_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_APP_SECURITY_ADMIN_TOKEN
@empresaAdminId = 99
@agentKeyId = 1

###
### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

###
### Upload ZIP (rota principal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/upload?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="nfe.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./docs/nfe.zip
--UploadBoundary--

###
### Upload ZIP (alias legado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/importacoes/upload?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="nfe.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./docs/nfe.zip
--UploadBoundary--

###
### Manifest (rota principal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "99/99/9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869.xml",
      "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
      "sizeBytes": 1500,
      "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Manifest (alias legado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/importacoes/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "99/99/nfe-001.xml",
      "sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "sizeBytes": 14320,
      "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Importação por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}

###
### Itens da importação (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/items?page=0&size=20

###
### Itens da importação por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/items?status=PARSEADO&page=0&size=20

###
### Documento por chave de acesso
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{accessKey}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}

###
### Cenário de erro 422 (objectKey inexistente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "99/99/nao-existe.xml",
      "sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"
    }
  ]
}

###
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### SEGURANÇA AGENT (fase 1)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

###
### Agent Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/session
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: desktop-agent-01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### Agent Session - repetir em burst para validar 429 + Retry-After
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/session
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### Agent Upload URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: desktop-agent-01
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
  "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml",
  "sizeBytes": 1500
}

###
### Agent Upload URL - cenário duplicado (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
  "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml",
  "sizeBytes": 1500
}

###
### Agent Upload URL - repetir em burst para validar 429 + Retry-After
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "originalFileName": "burst-test.xml",
  "sizeBytes": 1500
}

###
### Manifest autenticado (contrato do agente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: desktop-agent-01
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "99/99/9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869.xml",
      "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
      "sizeBytes": 1500,
      "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Admin - criar Agent API Key (requer X-Admin-Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Servidor principal de XML"
}

###
### Admin - listar Agent API Keys (requer X-Admin-Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

###
### Admin - revogar Agent API Key (requer X-Admin-Token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys/{{agentKeyId}}
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

###
### Admin - rotacionar Agent API Key sem downtime (requer X-Admin-Token)
### `revokeOld=false` mantém a chave antiga ativa durante transição do agente
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys/{{agentKeyId}}/rotate?tenantId={{tenantId}}&revokeOld=false
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "rotacao sem downtime",
  "criadoPor": "admin"
}
